-- הסכם קיבוצי (4.3.2015) — שינוי רמות המורכבות וטבלאות השכר של מנהלים
-- וסגני מנהלים ראשונים: under §14 of the 2013 agreement, and from 1.3.2014
-- notwithstanding it, the principals and first deputies of primary and
-- junior high schools, special-education schools and the other
-- institutions of §3 in the civil service get complexity levels 1–8 set by
-- the Ministry by stated parameters (chapter א); new salary tables (the
-- fifteen annexes) with the rules that place a new principal (chapter ב)
-- or a new first deputy (chapter ג) in them; the transition of existing
-- principals (chapter ד) and first deputies (chapter ה) to them, with a
-- notional pay G, the order in which their supplements absorb a rise, and
-- a salary-protection supplement Z where the new table pays less; new
-- frontal-hours tables from 1.9.2015 (chapter ו); the pay that follows a
-- change of level, with a floor for eight years in office (chapter ז); and
-- the voiding of the base agreement's §§65, 66, 67, 90(ב) and 92–93.
--
-- It amends the base agreement (25.12.2008) and the completion agreement
-- (29.2.2012), so it imports what it applies — the conversion of §§44–45,
-- the frontal hours of §§64 and 90 it replaces, the grade nearest at or
-- above of §65, the placement in a row of §46, the salary-protection
-- supplement of §38ב(ב) as the completion agreement added it — and the
-- table types of the agreement of 25.1.2011, whose tables these replace.
-- The follow-up committee's decision of 12.3.2013, the 2013 agreement
-- (17.9.2013) and the Oz LaTmura agreement (14.8.2011) are not encoded
-- here: what they decide is an input. The annexes are DATA, cell for cell
-- as the corpus publishes them.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT parties
IMPORT `base-agreement-common`
IMPORT `base-agreement-44`
IMPORT `base-agreement-46`
IMPORT `base-agreement-64`
IMPORT `base-agreement-65`
IMPORT `base-agreement-90`
IMPORT `2011-01-25_ofek-hadash_tosefet-2011-first-part_tables`
IMPORT `2012-02-29_ofek-hadash_amendment_hascam-hashlama`

§ `הסכם המנהלים וסגני המנהלים הראשונים — 4.3.2015`

-- akn:preamble The agreement's frame: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:preamble/p1 The registration stamp under the Collective Agreements Law (15.07.2015, no. 99/2015); no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p2 The document's title; no rule.

-- The day of signing, written in by hand.
@ref akn:preamble/p3
`the signing of the 2015 principals' agreement` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 4 3 2015

-- The parties: the State, by the Treasury's wages commissioner and the
-- Ministry of Education's director-general, and the teachers' union, by its
-- secretary-general.
@ref akn:preamble/p4 akn:preamble/p5 akn:preamble/p7 akn:preamble/p8
`the 2015 principals' agreement's parties` MEANS LIST `the State`, `the teachers' union`

-- akn:preamble/p6 "On the one side"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p9 "On the other side"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p10 A recital: the base agreement and the completion agreement anchored the principals' and first deputies' terms; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p11 A recital: the follow-up committee's decision of 12.3.2013 changed principals' pay for תשע"ג under §67 as amended; §45's F is the pay but for it, an input.
-- akn:preamble/p12 A recital: §14 of the 2013 agreement agreed changes in complexity levels and in the principals' and deputies' tables within its cost; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p13 A recital: the parties negotiated those changes under the 2013 agreement; no rule.

-- The changes apply retroactively from 1.3.2014, notwithstanding the 2013
-- agreement — the "determining day" of §40(א).
@ref akn:preamble/p14
`the 2015 principals' changes apply from` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2014

-- akn:preamble/p15 The words of agreement that introduce the clauses; no rule.

DECLARE `part of the 2015 principals' agreement` IS ONE OF `its recitals`, `its body`, `its annexes`

-- §1: the preamble and annexes are an inseparable part of it.
@ref akn:art_1
GIVEN p IS A `part of the 2015 principals' agreement`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `binds as the 2015 principals' agreement` p IF
    TRUE

#ASSERT `binds as the 2015 principals' agreement` `its annexes`

DECLARE `word form in the 2015 principals' agreement` IS ONE OF `masculine wording`, `feminine wording`, `singular wording`, `plural wording`

-- §2: masculine reads feminine and plural, and the reverse, unless
-- expressly stated otherwise.
@ref akn:art_2
GIVEN `written in` IS A `word form in the 2015 principals' agreement`, `read in` IS A `word form in the 2015 principals' agreement`, `expressly limited` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a word of the 2015 principals' agreement reads in another form` `written in` `read in` `expressly limited` IF
    (NOT `expressly limited`) OR `written in` EQUALS `read in`

#ASSERT `a word of the 2015 principals' agreement reads in another form` `masculine wording` `feminine wording` FALSE

§§ `3 תחולה`

DECLARE `institution under the 2015 principals' agreement` IS ONE OF
    `a primary school of 2015`
    `a junior high school of 2015`
    `a special-education school of 2015, multi-stage ones included`
    `a regional support centre of 2015`
    `a therapeutic centre of 2015`
    `a therapeutic centre for hearing impairment of 2015`
    `an adjacent Pais cluster of 2015`
    `a non-adjacent Pais cluster of 2015`
    `a Pisga centre of 2015`
    `a guidance centre of 2015`
    `an agricultural farm of 2015`
    `a marine centre of 2015`
    `another institution of 2015`

DECLARE `manager role under the 2015 principals' agreement` IS ONE OF
    `the principal of the institution`
    `the first deputy of the institution`
    `another post in the institution`

-- Employees on the teaching employees' scale employed as principals and
-- first deputies in the institutions §3 lists, in the civil service
-- ("בית ספר" or "מוסד חינוך").
@ref akn:art_3/p1
GIVEN `on the teaching employees' scale` IS A BOOLEAN
      `in the civil service` IS A BOOLEAN
      `role` IS A `manager role under the 2015 principals' agreement`
      `institution` IS AN `institution under the 2015 principals' agreement`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `covered by the 2015 principals' agreement` `on the teaching employees' scale` `in the civil service` `role` `institution` IF
        `on the teaching employees' scale`
    AND `in the civil service`
    AND NOT `role` EQUALS `another post in the institution`
    AND NOT `institution` EQUALS `another institution of 2015`

#ASSERT `covered by the 2015 principals' agreement` TRUE TRUE `the first deputy of the institution` `a marine centre of 2015`
#ASSERT NOT `covered by the 2015 principals' agreement` TRUE TRUE `another post in the institution` `a primary school of 2015`

§§ `4 תקופת ההסכם`

-- From 1.3.2014 to 30.6.2015 (convention dates.start and dates.end: both
-- days in).
@ref akn:art_4/p1
`the 2015 principals' agreement ends` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 30 6 2015

GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `within the 2015 principals' agreement's period` d IF
    d `is on or after` `the 2015 principals' changes apply from` AND d `is on or before` `the 2015 principals' agreement ends`

#ASSERT `within the 2015 principals' agreement's period` (DATE_FROM_DMY 30 6 2015)
#ASSERT NOT `within the 2015 principals' agreement's period` (DATE_FROM_DMY 28 2 2014)

§§ `5 הגדרות`

-- The definitions of §7 of the base agreement, as §5 of the completion
-- agreement amended them (encoded there and imported with it), apply here,
-- and so does any later change to them.
@ref akn:art_5/p1
`the base agreement's definitions apply to the 2015 principals' agreement as amended from time to time` MEANS TRUE

§§ `א. קביעת רמות מורכבות חדשות`

-- akn:chp_1 The heading of chapter א; its articles follow.

-- §6: the Ministry sets complexity levels from 1 to 8 for the
-- institutions it lists (every institution of §3).
@ref akn:art_6
GIVEN level IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a complexity level of 2015` level IF
    level AT LEAST 1 AND level AT MOST 8 AND FLOOR level EQUALS level

#ASSERT `a complexity level of 2015` 8 AND NOT `a complexity level of 2015` 9

DECLARE `2015 principals' agreement action` IS ONE OF
    `give the union written notice of the institutions' complexity levels`
    `set a new institution's complexity level`
    `pay the differences of a new institution's level`
    `discuss in the follow-up committee the pay of a new manager it is referred`
    `negotiate further economic demands for the agreement's period`
    `raise a further claim under §14 of the 2013 agreement`
    `strike, lock out or otherwise disrupt work over a matter the agreement settles`
    `decide a dispute over the agreement's application or reading`

-- §7: written notice to the union by 30 June every year, whether a level
-- changed or not. Time in days from 1 January of the year.
@ref akn:art_7
GIVEN `year` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `2015 principals' agreement action`
DECIDE `the 2015 yearly notice of the levels` `year` IS
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
    MUST  `give the union written notice of the institutions' complexity levels`
    WITHIN DATE_SERIAL (DATE_FROM_DMY 30 6 `year`) MINUS DATE_SERIAL (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 `year`)
    LEST BREACH BY `the Ministry of Education` BECAUSE "§7: notice of the complexity levels to the union by 30 June every year"

-- §8: a new institution's level for a school year is set by December of
-- that year, on the data of that time; until then the lowest level its
-- kind may have, and its principal and deputies are paid by it; once set,
-- the level runs from the start of the school year, and the differences
-- are paid with the December salary at the latest. ¶2: §§7–8 take nothing
-- from the Collective Agreements Law, 1957. ¶3: a "new institution" was not
-- active as an official institution in the year before and is in the year
-- the level is set for.
@ref akn:art_8 akn:art_8/p2 akn:art_8/p3
GIVEN `active as an official institution the year before` IS A BOOLEAN, `active as an official institution this year` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a new institution under §8` `active as an official institution the year before` `active as an official institution this year` IF
    (NOT `active as an official institution the year before`) AND `active as an official institution this year`

GIVEN `the lowest level its kind may have` IS A NUMBER, `the level set by December` IS A MAYBE NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a new institution's level for the year` `the lowest level its kind may have` `the level set by December` IS
    CONSIDER `the level set by December`
    WHEN JUST l THEN l
    WHEN NOTHING THEN `the lowest level its kind may have`

GIVEN `the year opens in` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `2015 principals' agreement action`
DECIDE `setting a new institution's level` `the year opens in` IS
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
    MUST  `set a new institution's complexity level`
    WITHIN DATE_SERIAL (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 `the year opens in`) MINUS DATE_SERIAL (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 `the year opens in`)
    HENCE (PARTY `the State`
           MUST  `pay the differences of a new institution's level`
           WITHIN 31
           LEST BREACH BY `the State` BECAUSE "§8: the differences are paid with the December salary at the latest")
    LEST BREACH BY `the Ministry of Education` BECAUSE "§8: a new institution's level is set by December of the school year"

`§§7–8 take nothing from the Collective Agreements Law` MEANS TRUE

#ASSERT `a new institution's level for the year` 1 NOTHING EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `a new institution's level for the year` 1 (JUST 3) EQUALS 3
#ASSERT `a new institution under §8` FALSE TRUE

-- ¶4–¶9: the definitions the parameters use. A standard class in ordinary
-- or special education is one budgeted as such by the Ministry's rules on
-- opening classes, as they are from time to time, their number set by
-- those rules and the pupils on the day the census closes; a standard
-- kindergarten class in a young division is one attached to the school,
-- approved and active on that day; a standard hour is a weekly hour the
-- Ministry budgets by its rules on the day the level is computed. They are
-- the Ministry's counts, inputs to the levels.
@ref akn:art_8/p4 akn:art_8/p5 akn:art_8/p6 akn:art_8/p7 akn:art_8/p8 akn:art_8/p9
DECLARE `2015 complexity parameter` IS ONE OF
    `standard classes in all, ordinary and special, young division included`
    `standard classes in grades 7 to 9`
    `standard special-education classes`
    `standard classes in the school`
    `the kinds of special-education classes`
    `the stages of education in the school`
    `whether it is a medical institution`
    `standard classes the centre serves`
    `local authorities the centre serves`
    `standard hours allotted`
    `teaching employees the centre serves`

-- §§9–15: the parameters weighed for each kind of institution. How they
-- are weighed is not printed: an institution's level is an input.
@ref akn:art_9 akn:art_9__para_a akn:art_9__para_b akn:art_9__para_c akn:art_10 akn:art_10__para_a akn:art_10__para_b akn:art_10__para_c akn:art_10__para_d akn:art_11 akn:art_11__para_a akn:art_11__para_b akn:art_12 akn:art_13 akn:art_14 akn:art_15
GIVEN k IS AN `institution under the 2015 principals' agreement`
GIVETH A LIST OF `2015 complexity parameter`
DECIDE `the 2015 parameters weighed for` k IS
    CONSIDER k
    WHEN `a primary school of 2015` THEN
        LIST `standard classes in all, ordinary and special, young division included`, `standard classes in grades 7 to 9`, `standard special-education classes`
    WHEN `a junior high school of 2015` THEN
        LIST `standard classes in all, ordinary and special, young division included`, `standard classes in grades 7 to 9`, `standard special-education classes`
    WHEN `a special-education school of 2015, multi-stage ones included` THEN
        LIST `standard classes in the school`, `the kinds of special-education classes`, `the stages of education in the school`, `whether it is a medical institution`
    WHEN `a regional support centre of 2015` THEN
        LIST `standard classes the centre serves`, `local authorities the centre serves`
    WHEN `a therapeutic centre for hearing impairment of 2015` THEN LIST `standard hours allotted`
    WHEN `a Pisga centre of 2015` THEN LIST `teaching employees the centre serves`
    WHEN `a non-adjacent Pais cluster of 2015` THEN LIST `standard hours allotted`
    WHEN `an agricultural farm of 2015` THEN LIST `standard hours allotted`
    WHEN `a marine centre of 2015` THEN LIST `standard hours allotted`
    OTHERWISE EMPTY

#ASSERT count (`the 2015 parameters weighed for` `a special-education school of 2015, multi-stage ones included`) EQUALS 4

§§ `ב. שכר מנהלים חדשים`

-- §16(א): a "new principal" was appointed to his post after this
-- agreement began. §40(ב): an "existing principal" held the post on the
-- eve of the determining day (1.3.2014).
-- F-ofek-hadash-principals-2015-h: one appointed on 1.3.2014 itself is
-- neither — not "after" the start, not in post on its eve. The reading
-- adopted (convention dates.start: a period from a day includes it): he is
-- new.
@ref akn:art_16__para_a
GIVEN `appointed on` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a new principal of 2015` `appointed on` IF
    `appointed on` `is on or after` `the 2015 principals' changes apply from`

GIVEN `appointed on` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `appointed after the start, as printed` `appointed on` IF
    DATE_SERIAL `appointed on` GREATER THAN DATE_SERIAL `the 2015 principals' changes apply from`

GIVEN `appointed on` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `in post on the eve of the determining day` `appointed on` IF
    DATE_SERIAL `appointed on` LESS THAN DATE_SERIAL `the 2015 principals' changes apply from`

`one appointed on the determining day is neither new nor existing, as printed` MEANS
        NOT `appointed after the start, as printed` `the 2015 principals' changes apply from`
    AND NOT `in post on the eve of the determining day` `the 2015 principals' changes apply from`
#ASSERT `one appointed on the determining day is neither new nor existing, as printed`
#ASSERT `a new principal of 2015` `the 2015 principals' changes apply from`

-- (ב): a new principal's "determining salary" is the table pay, the
-- doctorate allowance and the role allowances he had on the eve of his
-- appointment, without a trailing counselling or management allowance.
@ref akn:art_16__para_b
GIVEN `table pay on the eve` IS A NUMBER, `doctorate allowance on the eve` IS A NUMBER, `role allowances on the eve, the trailing ones left out` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a new principal's determining salary` `table pay on the eve` `doctorate allowance on the eve` `role allowances on the eve, the trailing ones left out` IS
    `table pay on the eve` PLUS `doctorate allowance on the eve` PLUS `role allowances on the eve, the trailing ones left out`

-- (ג): "Oz LaTmura terms" are the employment terms of the collective
-- agreement of 14.8.2011 with the post-primary teachers' organisation, as
-- amended (not encoded here).
@ref akn:art_16__para_c
DECLARE `the terms a new manager came from` IS ONE OF
    `Ofek Hadash terms, as a teacher`
    `Ofek Hadash terms, in another role`
    `Oz LaTmura terms, as a teacher`
    `Oz LaTmura terms, as a principal or deputy`
    `a guidance role, before its reform agreement`
    `no reform's terms`

-- §17: chapter ב is for new principals. §18: a new principal is paid by
-- annexes א–ב.
@ref akn:art_17
`chapter ב of 2015 reaches` MEANS `the principal of the institution`

-- The annex a new principal is paid by: ב for a principal of a junior high
-- school adjacent to a primary school ("חט"ב צמודה"), א otherwise.
@ref akn:art_18
GIVEN `heads an adjacent junior high school` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `2015 salary annex`
DECIDE `the annex a new principal is paid by` `heads an adjacent junior high school` IS
    IF `heads an adjacent junior high school` THEN `annex ב of 2015` ELSE `annex א of 2015`

-- §19: a new principal who was on Ofek Hadash terms before his appointment
-- is placed, by the level of the institution he heads, at the grade whose
-- pay is the nearest to his determining salary for a full position on
-- those terms times a coefficient, equal to it or above it ("השכר
-- לשיבוץ"): (1) 1.1 if he was a teacher; (2) 1.05 if he held another role
-- (first or further deputy, counsellor, kindergarten or cluster manager,
-- young-division head). §27: one whose salary for placement is above the
-- highest grade's pay at his level is placed at the highest grade. Both
-- are §46's placement in a row (the first cell at or above; none, the
-- last), imported.
@ref akn:art_19 akn:art_19/p2 akn:art_19__para_1 akn:art_19__para_2
GIVEN `came from` IS A `the terms a new manager came from`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the coefficient of §19` `came from` IS
    IF `came from` EQUALS `Ofek Hadash terms, as a teacher` THEN 1.1 ELSE 1.05

-- §20: notwithstanding the above, one of §19 who on the eve was entitled to
-- one or more of the supplements of §20.2 has as his salary for placement
-- the higher of: 20.1 his determining salary times the coefficient; 20.2
-- his table pay, role allowances and those supplements on the eve, not
-- multiplied — (א) a trailing counselling allowance, (ב) a trailing
-- management allowance, (ג) §38ב's salary-protection supplement, (ד)
-- §38ג's, (ה) §92א(ג)'s (all three as the completion agreement added them).
@ref akn:art_20 akn:art_20__para_20-1 akn:art_20__para_20-2 akn:art_20__para_20-2__subpara_a akn:art_20__para_20-2__subpara_b akn:art_20__para_20-2__subpara_c akn:art_20__para_20-2__subpara_d akn:art_20__para_20-2__subpara_e
GIVEN `determining salary for a full position` IS A NUMBER
      `came from` IS A `the terms a new manager came from`
      `table pay and role allowances on the eve` IS A NUMBER
      `the supplements of §20.2 on the eve` IS A NUMBER @desc a trailing counselling or management allowance, and the salary-protection supplements of §§38ב, 38ג and 92א(ג), in shekels
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a new principal's salary for placement` `determining salary for a full position` `came from` `table pay and role allowances on the eve` `the supplements of §20.2 on the eve` IS
    IF `the supplements of §20.2 on the eve` GREATER THAN 0
    THEN max (`determining salary for a full position` TIMES `the coefficient of §19` `came from`)
             (`table pay and role allowances on the eve` PLUS `the supplements of §20.2 on the eve`)
    ELSE `determining salary for a full position` TIMES `the coefficient of §19` `came from`

GIVEN `salary for placement` IS A NUMBER, `the row at his level` IS A LIST OF `grade cell`
GIVETH A MAYBE `grade cell`
DECIDE `a new manager's 2015 placement` `salary for placement` `the row at his level` IS
    `the placement in the row` `salary for placement` `the row at his level`

-- §21: a new principal who was a teacher on Oz LaTmura terms is placed by
-- his level at the grade nearest to his determining salary for a full
-- position on those terms. ¶2: that salary is the combined pay (basic pay
-- and seniority), the supplements 87, 94, 2001, 2008, Oz LaTmura, 2011 and
-- the 2011 erosion supplement, the second-degree, doctorate, training and
-- double-degree allowances, every role allowance, the profession and
-- qualifications allowance and the split allowance he had on the eve.
-- F-ofek-hadash-principals-2015-d: §§21, 25(ב) and 37(ב) say "the nearest"
-- where §§19 and 32 add "equal to it or above it". The reading adopted
-- (convention reading.consistent): at or above, as §§19 and 32 and the base
-- agreement's §65(ג).
@ref akn:art_21 akn:art_21/p2
DECLARE `Oz LaTmura pay component of 2015` IS ONE OF
    `the combined pay, basic and seniority`
    `supplement 87`
    `supplement 94`
    `supplement 2001`
    `supplement 2008`
    `the Oz LaTmura supplement`
    `supplement 2011`
    `the 2011 erosion supplement`
    `the second-degree allowance`
    `the third-degree allowance`
    `the training allowance`
    `the double-degree allowance`
    `a role allowance`
    `the profession and qualifications allowance`
    `the split allowance`

GIVEN `amount of each component on the eve` IS A FUNCTION FROM `Oz LaTmura pay component of 2015` TO NUMBER
      components IS A LIST OF `Oz LaTmura pay component of 2015`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the Oz LaTmura determining salary` `amount of each component on the eve` components IS
    sum (map `amount of each component on the eve` components)

GIVEN `determining salary on Oz LaTmura terms for a full position` IS A NUMBER, `the row at his level` IS A LIST OF `grade cell`
GIVETH A MAYBE `grade cell`
DECIDE `a new principal's placement from Oz LaTmura` `determining salary on Oz LaTmura terms for a full position` `the row at his level` IS
    `a new manager's 2015 placement` `determining salary on Oz LaTmura terms for a full position` `the row at his level`

-- The nearest either way, which §§21, 25(ב) and 37(ב) print, set beside the
-- nearest at or above, which §§19 and 32 print.
GIVEN target IS A NUMBER, `the row at his level` IS A LIST OF `grade cell`
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the pay nearest either way` target `the row at his level` IS
    listToMaybe (map (GIVEN c YIELD c's pay)
                     (sortBy (GIVEN a, b YIELD
                                  max (a's pay MINUS target) (target MINUS a's pay)
                                  AT MOST max (b's pay MINUS target) (target MINUS b's pay))
                             `the row at his level`))

-- §22: a new principal who was a part-time teacher on Ofek Hadash terms
-- and in a further part-time position on other terms is placed on his
-- determining salary on Ofek Hadash terms for a full position. §23: one who
-- was a part-time teacher on Oz LaTmura terms and in a further part not on
-- Ofek Hadash terms, on his Oz LaTmura determining salary for a full
-- position. (§26 ¶2 and §36 ¶2: a part in guidance with a part on Ofek
-- Hadash terms is §22's, and §33's for a deputy.)
@ref akn:art_22 akn:art_23
DECLARE `the terms a new manager's salary for placement is computed on` IS ONE OF
    `on his Ofek Hadash terms, for a full position`
    `on his Oz LaTmura terms, for a full position`
    `by another rule of the chapter`

GIVEN `had a part on Ofek Hadash terms` IS A BOOLEAN, `had a part as a teacher on Oz LaTmura terms` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `the terms a new manager's salary for placement is computed on`
DECIDE `the terms a part-time new manager is placed on` `had a part on Ofek Hadash terms` `had a part as a teacher on Oz LaTmura terms` IS
    BRANCH IF `had a part on Ofek Hadash terms` THEN `on his Ofek Hadash terms, for a full position`
           IF `had a part as a teacher on Oz LaTmura terms` THEN `on his Oz LaTmura terms, for a full position`
           OTHERWISE `by another rule of the chapter`

#ASSERT `the terms a part-time new manager is placed on` TRUE TRUE EQUALS `on his Ofek Hadash terms, for a full position`

-- §24: a new principal who was a principal or deputy on Oz LaTmura terms:
-- the follow-up committee discusses his case. §24 calls it the committee
-- "of chapter ח"; F-ofek-hadash-principals-2015-b: the committee is in the
-- chapter printed ט (§§26, 35 and 36 say ט'), chapter ח being industrial
-- peace. The reading adopted (convention reading.misprint): the committee
-- of chapter ט.
-- §26: one who was in a guidance role: the follow-up committee discusses
-- his case once a collective agreement applies a reform to guidance
-- employees (§155(ב) of the base agreement, §§12 and 17(ב) of the 2013
-- agreement).
@ref akn:art_24 akn:art_26
GIVEN `came from` IS A `the terms a new manager came from`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a new manager's pay goes to the follow-up committee` `came from` IF
    `came from` EQUALS `Oz LaTmura terms, as a principal or deputy` OR `came from` EQUALS `a guidance role, before its reform agreement`

GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `2015 principals' agreement action`
DECIDE `the follow-up committee's discussion of a referred new manager` IS
    PARTY `the follow-up committee`
    MUST  `discuss in the follow-up committee the pay of a new manager it is referred`

`the chapter §24 names for the follow-up committee` MEANS "ח"
`the chapter §§26, 35 and 36 name for it` MEANS "ט"
`the chapter printed over the follow-up committee` MEANS "ט"
`the chapter printed over industrial peace` MEANS "ח"

