            `row` 7 (JUST 8) `no step` (LIST `cell` 1 8701, `cell` 1.5 8995, `cell` 2 9289, `cell` 2.5 9608, `cell` 3 9928, `cell` 3.5 10276, `cell` 4 10623)

GIVEN a IS A `2015 salary annex`
GIVETH A LIST OF `table row`
DECIDE `the rows of the 2015 annex` a IS
    CONSIDER a
    WHEN `annex א of 2015` THEN `the rows of annex א of 2015`
    WHEN `annex ב of 2015` THEN `the rows of annex ב of 2015`
    WHEN `annex ג of 2015` THEN `the rows of annex ג of 2015`
    WHEN `annex ד of 2015` THEN `the rows of annex ד of 2015`
    WHEN `annex ה of 2015` THEN `the rows of annex ה of 2015`
    WHEN `annex ו of 2015` THEN `the rows of annex ו of 2015`
    WHEN `annex ז of 2015` THEN `the rows of annex ז of 2015`
    WHEN `annex ח of 2015` THEN `the rows of annex ח of 2015`
    WHEN `annex ט of 2015` THEN `the rows of annex ט of 2015`
    WHEN `annex י of 2015` THEN `the rows of annex י of 2015`
    WHEN `annex יא of 2015` THEN `the rows of annex יא of 2015`
    WHEN `annex יב of 2015` THEN `the rows of annex יב of 2015`
    WHEN `annex יג of 2015` THEN `the rows of annex יג of 2015`
    WHEN `annex יד of 2015` THEN `the rows of annex יד of 2015`
    WHEN `annex טו of 2015` THEN `the rows of annex טו of 2015`

-- A table's cells at a complexity level, and its pay at a level and grade.
GIVEN a IS A `2015 salary annex`, level IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A LIST OF `grade cell`
DECIDE `the cells at level` a level IS
    concat (map (GIVEN r YIELD r's `row cells`) (filter (GIVEN r YIELD r's `row label` EQUALS JUST level) (`the rows of the 2015 annex` a)))

GIVEN a IS A `2015 salary annex`, level IS A NUMBER, `the grade` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the 2015 table pay` a level `the grade` IS
    `the pay at grade` `the grade` (`the cells at level` a level)

§§ `בדיקת הנספחים`

-- The checks, over every cell. (1) The new principals' and deputies'
-- tables (א, ב, ג) are the existing ones (ד, ח, יב) without their
-- intermediate grades.
GIVEN a IS A `2015 salary annex`, b IS A `2015 salary annex`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 2015 cells of one annex printed otherwise in another` a b IS
    count (filter (GIVEN r YIELD
                       any (GIVEN c YIELD NOT (`the 2015 table pay` b (fromMaybe 0 (r's `row label`)) (c's grade) EQUALS JUST (c's pay)))
                           (r's `row cells`))
                  (`the rows of the 2015 annex` a))

#ASSERT `the 2015 cells of one annex printed otherwise in another` `annex א of 2015` `annex ד of 2015` EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the 2015 cells of one annex printed otherwise in another` `annex ב of 2015` `annex ח of 2015` EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the 2015 cells of one annex printed otherwise in another` `annex ג of 2015` `annex יב of 2015` EQUALS 0

-- (2) Every intermediate grade is within half a shekel of the midpoint of
-- the grades either side of it.
GIVEN a IS A `2015 salary annex`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `every 2015 intermediate grade lies at the midpoint, to half a shekel` a IS
    all (GIVEN r YIELD
             all (GIVEN c YIELD
                      CONSIDER `the pay at grade` (c's grade MINUS 0.5) (r's `row cells`)
                      WHEN JUST lo THEN
                          CONSIDER `the pay at grade` (c's grade PLUS 0.5) (r's `row cells`)
                          WHEN JUST hi THEN max (c's pay MINUS (lo PLUS hi) DIVIDED BY 2) ((lo PLUS hi) DIVIDED BY 2 MINUS c's pay) AT MOST 0.5
                          WHEN NOTHING THEN TRUE
                      WHEN NOTHING THEN TRUE)
                 (filter (GIVEN c YIELD NOT (FLOOR (c's grade) EQUALS c's grade)) (r's `row cells`)))
        (`the rows of the 2015 annex` a)

#ASSERT all `every 2015 intermediate grade lies at the midpoint, to half a shekel` (LIST `annex ד of 2015`, `annex ה of 2015`, `annex ו of 2015`, `annex ז of 2015`, `annex ח of 2015`, `annex ט of 2015`, `annex י of 2015`, `annex יא of 2015`, `annex יב of 2015`, `annex יג of 2015`, `annex יד of 2015`, `annex טו of 2015`)

-- (3) The principals' tables print levels 1–8, the deputies' 2–8.
GIVEN a IS A `2015 salary annex`
GIVETH A LIST OF NUMBER
DECIDE `the levels a 2015 annex prints` a IS
    map (GIVEN r YIELD fromMaybe 0 (r's `row label`)) (`the rows of the 2015 annex` a)

#ASSERT `the levels a 2015 annex prints` `annex א of 2015` EQUALS range 1 8
#ASSERT `the levels a 2015 annex prints` `annex יא of 2015` EQUALS range 1 8
#ASSERT `the levels a 2015 annex prints` `annex ג of 2015` EQUALS range 2 8
#ASSERT `the levels a 2015 annex prints` `annex טו of 2015` EQUALS range 2 8
